WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.423 --> 00:00:02.936
<b>Jackson, 17</b>

2
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:07.036
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What kind of phone do you have?

3
00:00:07.419 --> 00:00:09.046
<v><b>Jackson:</b></v> An iPhone 14.

4
00:00:09.945 --> 00:00:11.334
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How old is it?

5
00:00:11.493 --> 00:00:17.100
I’m not sure how old it is. I got it in August, but it was my mum’s old phone.

6
00:00:17.338 --> 00:00:19.705
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How often do you change phones?

7
00:00:19.838 --> 00:00:23.395
<v><b>Jackson:</b></v> Probably every eighteen months to two years.

8
00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:27.336
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What do you use your phone for the most?

9
00:00:27.455 --> 00:00:30.074
<v><b>Jackson:</b></v> Messaging friends and social media.

10
00:00:30.285 --> 00:00:33.182
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How often do you make actual phone calls?

11
00:00:33.354 --> 00:00:34.914
<v><b>Jackson:</b></v> Almost never.

12
00:00:36.131 --> 00:00:38.445
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What apps do you use a lot?

13
00:00:38.855 --> 00:00:43.246
<v><b>Jackson:</b></v> I play a lot of sudoku. I have a sudoku app.

14
00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:46.751
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you have any unusual apps on your phone?

15
00:00:47.571 --> 00:00:51.300
<v><b>Jackson:</b></v> Not really. I think all my apps are pretty normal.

16
00:00:55.109 --> 00:00:57.106
<b>Sophie, 40</b>

17
00:00:59.076 --> 00:01:01.100
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What kind of phone do you have?

18
00:01:01.351 --> 00:01:03.335
<v><b>Sophie:</b></v> It’s a Xiaomi Redmi phone.

19
00:01:04.221 --> 00:01:05.583
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How old is it?

20
00:01:06.125 --> 00:01:08.175
<v><b>Sophie:</b></v> About a year old, I think.

21
00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:10.688
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How often do you change phones?

22
00:01:10.728 --> 00:01:13.545
<v><b>Sophie:</b></v> I hate changing phones, so not often.

23
00:01:13.915 --> 00:01:18.742
Unfortunately, my last phone only lasted three years because the battery stopped working.

24
00:01:20.025 --> 00:01:22.868
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What do you use your phone for the most?

25
00:01:22.974 --> 00:01:26.624
<v><b>Sophie:</b></v> I checked this on my phone, and it said mainly Google.

26
00:01:26.942 --> 00:01:33.078
I research places I’m going to go to, I check my email, I plan journeys using Google Maps,

27
00:01:33.105 --> 00:01:37.773
look for reviews for things I’m thinking of buying…I look up meanings of words,

28
00:01:37.932 --> 00:01:41.092
I use Google Translate. All on Google.

29
00:01:41.727 --> 00:01:44.769
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How often do you make actual phone calls?

30
00:01:45.563 --> 00:01:47.335
<v><b>Sophie:</b></v> Once in a blue moon.

31
00:01:47.705 --> 00:01:50.152
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What apps do you use a lot?

32
00:01:50.694 --> 00:01:55.217
<v><b>Sophie:</b></v> I also checked this, and it said a game called Tile Match!

33
00:01:55.706 --> 00:01:57.293
I was quite surprised!

34
00:01:57.571 --> 00:02:00.732
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you have any unusual apps on your phone?

35
00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:04.296
<v><b>Sophie:</b></v> I use an app called FlightTracker to pass the time while

36
00:02:04.296 --> 00:02:07.225
I’m waiting for a flight or waiting to meet someone.

37
00:02:07.371 --> 00:02:10.994
You can follow the path of a plane when it’s coming towards the airport.

38
00:02:11.338 --> 00:02:13.811
I also have an app for jigsaw puzzles.

39
00:02:13.944 --> 00:02:17.580
It’s really relaxing to do electronic jigsaw puzzles on your phone.

40
00:02:17.779 --> 00:02:18.731
Who knew!

41
00:02:22.236 --> 00:02:24.682
<b>Rose, 65</b>

42
00:02:26.454 --> 00:02:28.438
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What kind of phone do you have?

43
00:02:28.782 --> 00:02:34.032
<v><b>Rose:</b></v> I think it’s an iPhone 13. An iPhone anyway.

44
00:02:34.482 --> 00:02:35.871
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How old is it?

45
00:02:35.977 --> 00:02:38.582
<v><b>Rose:</b></v> I got it about two years ago.

46
00:02:39.045 --> 00:02:41.677
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How often do you change phones?

47
00:02:41.967 --> 00:02:47.668
<v><b>Rose:</b></v> Every three or four years, usually because the battery isn’t working very well.

48
00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:51.688
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What do you use your phone for the most?

49
00:02:52.138 --> 00:02:58.539
<v><b>Rose:</b></v> Texting people, checking the news and weather, sometimes Google Maps

50
00:02:58.539 --> 00:03:04.582
For directions, calling taxis, taking photos, listening to the radio.

51
00:03:04.648 --> 00:03:07.267
Oh, and I sometimes play solitaire.

52
00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:11.446
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How often do you make actual phone calls?

53
00:03:11.473 --> 00:03:15.533
<v><b>Rose:</b></v> Very rarely. Only to family or friends when I get

54
00:03:15.533 --> 00:03:18.138
bored of writing really long messages.

55
00:03:18.336 --> 00:03:20.651
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What apps do you use a lot?

56
00:03:21.087 --> 00:03:28.454
<v><b>Rose:</b></v> WhatsApp, Uber, or other taxi apps I have, the camera, BBC News,

57
00:03:28.467 --> 00:03:34.021
BBC Sounds (that’s the radio app). And banking apps.

58
00:03:34.564 --> 00:03:38.148
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you have any unusual apps on your phone?

59
00:03:38.491 --> 00:03:43.305
<v><b>Rose:</b></v> I have an app for identifying birds by recording their songs

60
00:03:43.411 --> 00:03:47.551
and another to identify flowers by taking a photo.

61
00:03:47.696 --> 00:03:51.267
I sometimes use them when I go for a walk in the country.